      "content": "satin, a silk fabric with a glossy surface on one side (OED s.v. satin n.); Bruges satin made with a warp of silk and a woof of thread (OED s.v. silk 1b); measured in lb; dyed or not dyed with kermes (q.v.); also made in Cyprus"
